        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Count visits, not hours",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Verb + number + 回 counts occasions. In 去了三回书店, the count is three visits, not three hours spent there. 回 is the occasion counter in this position, not the verb return.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我去了三回书店。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ qù le sān huí shūdiàn 。",
                "meaning": "I went to the bookshop three times.",
                "audio": "1e2977b2ea685d735aa5652cd773f9d4ab12c45a06a6f3359c42dbb902eb2e26"
              }
            ]
